1
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:04,480
You're late.

2
00:01:05,010 --> 00:01:07,600
The rain had opinions about the bridge.

3
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,900
<i>Somewhere a door closed.</i>

4
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,750
Sit down, Marek.
You're making the room nervous.

5
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:18,100
I can't carry this alone.

6
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:21,340
Nobody asked you to carry anything.

7
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,200
Room 412, and don't knock twice.

8
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:28,900
The last train leaves at midnight.

9
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:32,000
Then we have four hours
to be wrong about each other.

10
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,800
You keep asking me for the truth

11
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:38,600
when what you really want is permission.

12
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,900
That's not fair.

13
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:45,000
Fair is a thing people say
before they leave.

14
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,900
No sabés lo que me costó llegar hasta acá.

15
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:07,100
Entonces contámelo despacio.

16
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,700
Nobody walks out of this room clean.

17
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:13,800
I stopped believing in clean
a long time ago.

18
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:17,200
There's a name on that envelope.

19
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:20,400
If you read it, you're in it.

20
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,600
I've been in it since the harbour.

21
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,700
I missed the last train on purpose.

22
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:41,000
Everybody does, the first time.

23
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:44,500
Second time it's a decision.

24
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,800
Put the light out.

25
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:08,000
They can see the smoke from the water.

26
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,900
You keep asking me for the truth.

27
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:15,100
I'm done asking.

28
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,900
Good. Questions were the expensive part.

29
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Tell them the bridge was already down
when we got there.

30
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:36,200
And if they ask about the girl?

31
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,900
Then you tell them nothing, slowly.

32
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
<i>The train pulled out without either of them.</i>
